```json
{
  "sql": "SELECT 
  (SELECT DISTINCT T1.Affiliation 
   FROM university AS T1 
   JOIN basketball_match AS T2 ON T1.School_ID = T2.School_ID 
   WHERE T2.All_Games_Percent > 0 AND T2.All_Games_Percent > 1850) AS affiliations,
  (SELECT COUNT(*) 
   FROM university AS T1 
   JOIN basketball_match AS T2 ON T1.School_ID = T2.School_ID 
   WHERE T2.All_Games_Percent > 0 AND T2.All_Games_Percent > 1850) AS total_enrollments"
}
```

This query uses two subqueries to get the affiliations and total enrollments. The first subquery selects the affiliations where the games percentage is greater than 0 and greater than 1850. The second subquery counts the total number of enrollments for each affiliation.
