SELECT 
  p.part_id, 
  p.amount
FROM 
  Parts p
  JOIN 
  (SELECT 
     maintenance_contract_id, 
     SUM(CASE WHEN chargeable_amount > 0 THEN chargeable_amount ELSE 0 END) AS amount
   FROM 
     Maintenance_Contracts
   GROUP BY 
     maintenance_contract_id) AS subquery
  ON p.maintenance_contract_id = subquery.maintenance_contract_id
WHERE 
  p.amount = (
    SELECT 
      MIN(amount)
    FROM 
      (SELECT 
         maintenance_contract_id, 
         SUM(CASE WHEN chargeable_amount > 0 THEN chargeable_amount ELSE 0 END) AS amount
       FROM 
         Maintenance_Contracts
       GROUP BY 
         maintenance_contract_id) AS subquery
  );
```

This query uses a subquery to calculate the total chargeable amount for each maintenance contract. It then joins this subquery with the `Parts` table to get the part with the minimum chargeable amount. The result is filtered to only include rows where the chargeable amount is equal to the minimum chargeable amount.
