This query joins the required tables to find the names of nurses who are nursing an undergoing treatment. The `WHERE` clause filters the results to only include rows where the `Name` of the treatment is 'treatment'. The `DISTINCT` keyword ensures that each nurse is only listed once.
```sql
SELECT 
  P.Name AS NurseName, 
  P.Position, 
  P.SSN, 
  A.Name AS AppointmentName, 
  A.Start, 
  A.End, 
