ORDER BY 
  P.SSN, 
  A.Start, 
  M.Brand, 
  M.Description;
```

This query joins the `Patient`, `Appointment`, `Prescribes`, and `Medication` tables to get the required columns. It filters the results to only include appointments where the start and end dates are not null, and then orders the results by the patient's SSN, appointment start date, medication brand, and medication description.
