This query will return the details and star ratings of the three hotels with the lowest price ranges. The subquery in the FROM clause finds the minimum price range for each star rating, and the JOIN clause then selects the corresponding hotels with that price range. The ORDER BY clause sorts the results by star rating and price range, and the LIMIT clause limits the results to the top 3 hotels.
